TITLE 1D transport: Ca/Cl initial, Na/Cl inflow, exchange in all cells
SOLUTION 0  Inflow
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10 Initial cells
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected_hcl.tsv
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step cell HCl_m
10 PUNCH SIM_NO, CELL_NO, MOL("HCl")
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -dispersivity 0
    -punch_cells 4
    -punch_frequency 1
END
